{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Srg. Waffles","id":"430898830498725888","is_bot":0,"username":"srg.waffles"},"author_id":"430898830498725888","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"What are your plans now?\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T04:50:46.708000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-25T04:50:59.761000Z","id":"879950914474098708","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Well...\" She kicks her feat. \"See the war through I guess. After that is a little more vague. Finn wants to get into politics more. I will likely send some support to France once their revolution comes.. after that maybe go out west.\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T04:56:37.542000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879952385978535996","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"What about you?\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T04:58:37.841000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879952890549125171","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Srg. Waffles","id":"430898830498725888","is_bot":0,"username":"srg.waffles"},"author_id":"430898830498725888","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Yeah, seems that everything is leading to that way. Finn would do well in politics and would probably make a change, and I know france would be in good hands with you as well.\" She looks distracted after thinking about the question. \"to be honest, I don't really know myself of what I'll do, I have duties here and would like to continue being a lamplighter. But I think I would follow our little group if I can. I know that Julie is most likely going to do so, and she's really the one I want to be with.\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T05:04:05.389000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879954264385024060","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Srg. Waffles","id":"430898830498725888","is_bot":0,"username":"srg.waffles"},"author_id":"430898830498725888","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Although, I might be looking into way to let her live my life time. What about you and Finn?\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T05:04:37.543000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879954399248646174","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"Vivicas smile dips and she moves to sit in her desk chair. \"I haven't really thought about that part... Finn thinks of everything, I'm sure he has some kind of plan or something.\" she pauses trying to lighten some \"Of course, you are more than welcome to stick around, you're basically a sister to me.\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T05:08:11.202000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879955295399448637","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
